  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-04-25T12:55:30.044Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the latest update bringing the VRChat Home world, I thought it would be interesting if we had several customization options:\n\n- Enable/disable the help-screens on the walls.\n\n- Customize what avatars are available to choose on the six pedestals beside the mirror, for example ones that you have uploaded.\n\n- Change the wallpaper and floor textures (from a pre-determined list).\n\n- Custom playlists on the video player.\n\nIdeally all of these changes would be persistent and you would not need to redo them every time you played or entered the world.",
